      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنشّب الشَّوْكُ بِالثَّوْبِ</span></b>  <i>The thorns caught in,</i>
or <i>to,</i> or <i>laid hold upon, the garment.</i> (Msb,
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">علق</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنشّب فِى قَلْبِهِ حُبُّهَا</span> (tropical:)  [<i>Love of her
took fast hold upon,</i> or <i>became fixed in, his heart</i>].
(A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See 1.

